        "version": "1",
        "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
        "effective_to": null,
        "text": "This policy applies to outpatient professional claims for magnetic resonance imaging of the brain, CPT 70551, 70552, and 70553, with dates of service on or after January 1, 2026."
